<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12265] JavaDoc doesn&apos;t have documentation for the org.apache.ignite.client package</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12265</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;JavaDoc published on the website doesn&apos;t have documentation for the &lt;tt&gt;org.apache.ignite.client&lt;/tt&gt;&#160;package. Link to the website: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ignite.apache.org/releases/2.7.6/javadoc/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ignite.apache.org/releases/2.7.6/javadoc/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A lack of &lt;tt&gt;package-info.java&lt;/tt&gt;&#160;file or exclusion from the &lt;tt&gt;maven-javadoc-plugin&lt;/tt&gt;&#160;in the root &lt;tt&gt;pom.xml&lt;/tt&gt;&#160;may be the reason.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
